# History

A dated record of what was done, newest entry last. This is a record, not a handbook: the
handbook is `README.md`, the operating rules are `AGENTS.md`.

Each entry: date, what was run (commands and page ranges), what it produced (counts, digests,
packet ids), what was decided and why the decision is in `docs/DECISIONS.md` if it is one.
Plugin upgrades get an entry with the re-measurement that showed the record unchanged.

